mee een letterlijk autobiografisch verslag wordt.","work_id":987140001,"evidence":[{"note":"Eighteen-story original1977MammoetOpZondag, regularPaperbackISBN9789029518697. Individual limited linen variants and individual Avondwandeling are not the whole Work.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p352345659","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p782098673","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p409254908","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p160118832","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413873366","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822044773","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p802540996"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-041.json#155","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.360Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-017.json","sources":["https://www.vanoorschot.nl/dbnl/kroniek-6/","https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/_med003mede01_01/_med003mede01_01_0326.php","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p352345659","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p782098673","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p409254908","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p160118832","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413873366","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822044773","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p802540996"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bound official bulk source reviewed once; no verified image available for import. Preserve resolver, inspect actual front/placeholder hosted. Do not infer Dutch absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789029518697","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":6732275,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"661d51a86f82f9bf19b025189d2de43e3566b0dd9dfadce9fed9bcb8e3c99a05"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.359Z","editi