uele gids. De uitspraken over hulp en genezing behoren tot de overtuigingen van de auteur en vormen geen onderbouwing van een medische behandeling.","work_id":987140003,"evidence":[{"note":"AngelTherapy1997 translates as GesprekkenMetEngelen9789022565407, exact KB original binding. Not2011AngelTherapyHandbook or oraclecards. Spiritual beliefs, no established healing claim or automatic taste eligibility.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p352633247"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-041.json#158","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.360Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-019.json","sources":["https://metadata.isbn.nl/182950/gesprekken-met-engelen.html","https://www.groenewaterman.be/nl/boeken/9789022565407/gesprekken-met-engelen","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p352633247"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bound official bulk source reviewed once; no verified image available for import. Preserve resolver, inspect actual front/placeholder hosted. Do not infer Dutch absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789022565407","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","coverId":13197036,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"661d51a86f82f9bf19b025189d2de43e3566b0dd9dfadce9fed9bcb8e3c99a05"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.359Z","editionKey":"/books/OL46531803M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/182950/gesprekken-met-engelen.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.36+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","so