ontact met anderen krijgen een andere betekenis wanneer haar lichaam niet meer doet wat zij verwacht. Haar zoektocht naar erkenning brengt ook de reacties van artsen en haar omgeving in beeld. In dit persoonlijke relaas over leven met ME onderzoekt zij wat er gebeurt met zelfstandigheid en zelfbeeld. Haar persoonlijke relaas laat zien hoe moeilijk het is uit te leggen wat voor de buitenwereld niet zichtbaar is.","work_id":987140007,"evidence":[{"note":"HedenIk1993, exactDutchPaperback9789025402266, Dorrestein literary illness memoir, notclinical instruction orfiction.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p104756799"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-041.json#197","checked_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.360Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-018.json","sources":["https://pure.uva.nl/ws/files/36436087/Een_wandelende_anomalie.pdf","https://www.patientervaringsverhalen.nl/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/bijlagen/Dorrestein.pdf","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p104756799"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bound official bulk source reviewed once; no verified image available for import. Preserve resolver, inspect actual front/placeholder hosted. Do not infer Dutch absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789025402266","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":6757928,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"661d51a86f82f9bf19b025189d2de43e3566b0dd9dfadce9fed9bcb8e3c99a05"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T08:39:50.360Z","editionKey":"/books/OL1502793M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary